{"parse": {"title": "轮与轴之芯", "pageid": 8626, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"轮与轴之芯\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/87/Item-110704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"轮与轴之芯\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>轮与轴之芯</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#110704</div></div><hr /><div>钟表的心房内铭刻着“精准”二字。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">经由打磨、镶嵌、玑镂雕花，而后即可得到一颗活泼的“心脏”。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">荒原合成</td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">迷途鉴定</td></tr></tbody></table><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">配方</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110703\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BC%AF%E6%9B%B2%E9%B9%85%E9%A2%88\" title=\"弯曲鹅颈\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BC%AF%E6%9B%B2%E9%B9%85%E9%A2%88\" title=\"弯曲鹅颈\"><img alt=\"弯曲鹅颈\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/Item-110703.png/100px-Item-110703.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/Item-110703.png/150px-Item-110703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/Item-110703.png/200px-Item-110703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BC%AF%E6%9B%B2%E9%B9%85%E9%A2%88\" title=\"弯曲鹅颈\">弯曲鹅颈</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">形如鹅颈般优美的零件。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×3</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110403\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A5%9D%E5%9C%A3%E7%A7%98%E9%93%B6\" title=\"祝圣秘银\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A5%9D%E5%9C%A3%E7%A7%98%E9%93%B6\" title=\"祝圣秘银\"><img alt=\"祝圣秘银\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Item-110403.png/100px-Item-110403.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Item-110403.png/150px-Item-110403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Item-110403.png/200px-Item-110403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A5%9D%E5%9C%A3%E7%A7%98%E9%93%B6\" title=\"祝圣秘银\">祝圣秘银</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">闪闪发光的银锭，祝圣仪式让它光可鉴人。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110103\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%95%AE%E5%92%AC%E7%9B%92\" title=\"啮咬盒\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%95%AE%E5%92%AC%E7%9B%92\" title=\"啮咬盒\"><img alt=\"啮咬盒\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Item-110103.png/100px-Item-110103.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Item-110103.png/150px-Item-110103.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Item-110103.png/200px-Item-110103.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%95%AE%E5%92%AC%E7%9B%92\" title=